    {
      "id": "s02",
      "type": "DIALOG_GATE",
      "transition": "zoom",
      "background": "zoneB",
      "narration": "That box comes from the browser, not your page. It freezes everything and no locator can reach it. So Playwright answers it for you, and it picks Cancel.",
      "data": {
        "dialogGate": {
          "message": "Are you sure you want to delete?",
          "kind": "confirm",
          "handler": "none",
          "trigger": "Delete account",
          "pageTitle": "Your account",
          "outcome": "nothing was deleted",
          "caption": "no error. no hang. a silent Cancel.",
          "color": "red",
          "atWord": 1,
          "knockAtWord": 5.167,
          "answerAtWord": 14.417,
          "rows": [
            {
              "label": "Profile settings"
            },
            {
              "label": "Your account",
              "title": "target"
            },
            {
              "label": "Billing history"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "durationFrames": 303,
      "audio": "audio/pw-dojo-12-dialogs-files_short_s02.mp3",
      "timingSource": "tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "type": "CODE_RUN",
      "transition": "push",
      "background": "zoneA",
      "narration": "The fix is one line, and the order is everything. Register your handler first. Then do the click that makes the box appear.",
      "data": {
        "codeRun": {
          "filename": "dialogs.py",
          "language": "py",
          "resultLabel": "what happens",
          "color": "green",
          "atWord": 2.667,
          "caption": "brief the doorman before the knock",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "page.once(\"dialog\",",
              "detail": "answer the next dialog with OK",
              "sub": "registered, and waiting",
              "label": "armed",
              "atWord": 6.833
            },
            {
              "text": "    lambda dialog: dialog.accept())"
            },
            {
              "text": "page.get_by_role(\"button\",",
              "detail": "now the click that makes it knock",
              "sub": "the box appears, accepted",
              "label": "clicked",
              "atWord": 14.333
            },
            {
              "text": "    name=\"Delete account\").click()"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "durationFrames": 251,
      "audio": "audio/pw-dojo-12-dialogs-files_short_s03.mp3",
      "timingSource": "tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "type": "RULE_TEST",
      "transition": "slide",
      "background": "zoneB",
      "narration": "So remember the order, not the syntax. Handler first, then click. The other way round is already too late.",
      "data": {
        "ruleTest": {
          "kicker": "the rule",
          "rule": "register the handler BEFORE the click",
          "okLabel": "answered",
          "noLabel": "auto-dismissed",
          "caption": "no handler means Cancel, every time",
          "color": "green",
          "atWord": 1,
          "cases": [
            {
              "text": "page.once(...) then click",
              "title": "ok",
              "sub": "somebody was ready",
              "atWord": 8.25
            },
            {
              "text": "click, then page.once(...)",
              "title": "no",
              "sub": "the box is already gone",
              "atWord": 10.917
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "durationFrames": 227,
      "audio": "audio/pw-dojo-12-dialogs-files_short_s04.mp3",
